{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/c6523793bbfa350d310d26682e043316.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes hailed as the greatest <i>Swords and Sandals\u00a0</i>of all time, this is the one I've always wanted to remake - and now, almost twenty years since its original launch, that dream is realised in all its vivid, bone shattering detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.poster.avif?t=1764280831\" width=598 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.webm?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.mp4?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hardest, most metal gladiator game ever made has been re-forged from the ground up, with new graphics and the most rocking soundtrack and the most brutal deaths ever seen in a Swords and Sandals game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/cf42953f0c3825c51607429d582f4db1.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Swords and Sandals III Redux\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Core Gameplay Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced turn-based arena combat. Fight one-on-one or in teams of two, dodge spiked pits and traps on your way to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between redux and classic graphics at any time, from gladiators to backgrounds to shopkeepers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limb severing and decapitations! Sever arms and legs and <i>keep on fighting</i> as your gladiator finds the strength to endure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful blueprints and runes to give your weapons and armour the edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a gladiator your way. Customize everything from height and weight to facial features and hometown, the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 classic Arena Champions to do battle with, including the infamous <i><strong>Yeti Project</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many classes to choose, skills and talents to learn. Rain molten death from the skies, play guitar solos that shake the ground! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemy anyway you can. Throw your weapons, even throw discarded healing potions. Whatever it takes to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-forged using the <i>Swords and Sandals Immortals</i> engine. This means cooler special FX, beefier particles, more fluid animations and more epic music than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sharpen your sword, sturdy your sandals. The <i><strong>Gladiae Ultratus</strong></i> awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/df5ca69740d420cf762a64f345c98e6b.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, by popular demand, you can now play as a powerful <i>Automaton</i> construct. These towering robotic overlords are absolute tanks and level up in a different way to regular gladiators. They are probably a little overpowered, but hey - this is <i>Swords and Sandals</i>, what's a little ridiculous balancing here and there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/278bf019f4cb4605859323f7da2d40f4.poster.avif?t=1764280831\" width=598 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/278bf019f4cb4605859323f7da2d40f4.webm?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/278bf019f4cb4605859323f7da2d40f4.mp4?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Greenhorn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/f56790734dfcd7f5d48eff7894d5622b7959bae0.jpg"},{"name":"Blood, Sweat and Cheers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/6359ccaa423510ca891919943eba03fec34f7897.jpg"},{"name":"Century of Carnage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/2554a4d033e04d355fa984141b525e44be9fd810.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Sand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/b9c1e35395acdc25887d742a4b9d45ab781044fd.jpg"},{"name":"All That Glitters is Yours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/12581c49f6bc4ce67feefe27296b3bd8b44ca71f.jpg"},{"name":"Celestial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/4914d6749296a1d9d69309b5759ed536fbf95ef3.jpg"},{"name":"Fear Is not In My Vocabulary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/4f7512ba7bf134c125c1d93b64a469226eedfc4b.jpg"},{"name":"I Thought You'd Be Bigger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/457807bf9e8d70b31fb58daeb42a4e0eb291ea95.jpg"},{"name":"Might Makes Right","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/4b02b8426c3e1baec92368b9a34e796c23edf97a.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2116620/ff724cc564668b845053b38b7d7fa980e6de35aa.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2116620?t=1764280831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/824cb588a9132fe628afd69a1b0a1bed64465fd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764280831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/6d7ef50896f65791ffe74fbd33f7ec55ec36ce78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764280831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/6d7ef50896f65791ffe74fbd33f7ec55ec36ce78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764280831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/c6523793bbfa350d310d26682e043316.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes hailed as the greatest <i>Swords and Sandals\u00a0</i>of all time, this is the one I've always wanted to remake - and now, almost twenty years since its original launch, that dream is realised in all its vivid, bone shattering detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.poster.avif?t=1764280831\" width=598 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.webm?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/da7290ea668d7771a639e598b7f5e0e8.mp4?t=1764280831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hardest, most metal gladiator game ever made has been re-forged from the ground up, with new graphics and the most rocking soundtrack and the most brutal deaths ever seen in a Swords and Sandals game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/cf42953f0c3825c51607429d582f4db1.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Swords and Sandals III Redux\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Core Gameplay Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced turn-based arena combat. Fight one-on-one or in teams of two, dodge spiked pits and traps on your way to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between redux and classic graphics at any time, from gladiators to backgrounds to shopkeepers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limb severing and decapitations! Sever arms and legs and <i>keep on fighting</i> as your gladiator finds the strength to endure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful blueprints and runes to give your weapons and armour the edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a gladiator your way. Customize everything from height and weight to facial features and hometown, the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 classic Arena Champions to do battle with, including the infamous <i><strong>Yeti Project</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many classes to choose, skills and talents to learn. Rain molten death from the skies, play guitar solos that shake the ground! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemy anyway you can. Throw your weapons, even throw discarded healing potions. Whatever it takes to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-forged using the <i>Swords and Sandals Immortals</i> engine. This means cooler special FX, beefier particles, more fluid animations and more epic music than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sharpen your sword, sturdy your sandals. The <i><strong>Gladiae Ultratus</strong></i> awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/df5ca69740d420cf762a64f345c98e6b.avif?t=1764280831\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, by popular demand, you can now play as a powerful <i>Automaton</i> construct. These towering robotic overlords are absolute tanks and level up in a different way to regular gladiators. They are probably a little overpowered, but hey - this is <i>Swords and Sandals</i>, what's a little ridiculous balancing here and there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116620/extras/278bf019f4cb4605859323f7da2d40f4.poster.avif?t=1764280831\" width=598 height=338 ><sourc